Subject: Odd curses bug - redirected stdout.
Message-ID: <1995Jan26.110256.21416@fs.com.au>
Organization: Functional Software, Perth, Australia
X-Newsreader: NN version 6.5.0 #22
Date: Thu, 26 Jan 1995 11:02:56 GMT
