RJ> Does anyone have a working zmodem program for OSF/1 AXP?  I have
RJ> a DEC 2100/A500MP running OSF/1 3.0 with rz/sz 3.03/ 3.00 from
RJ> gatekeeper.dec.com.  The download process, sz, appears to work
