The "routing" and the "Name Service" are different issues.  
"route add default gateway", where "gateway" is the "Terminal Server" or
whatever you are connecting to, establishes the "default route".

To setup the "Name Service"(BIND) use the "setup" script/menu or the
"bindsetup" and "svcsetup" scripts(see "/etc/resolv.conf" and "/etc/svc.conf"). 
First you will have to find out the BIND server name, which is not the same as 
the gateway above and the "domain name".

