Good luck finding someone at DEC to answer these questions--I think they
all work at Hewlett Packard now!

Seriously though.  As you probably know, DECServer 200s only send out
MOP load requests (not BOOTP).  Because of this you must have a process
on the OSF/1 system to handle MOP requests.  From the information I could
gather from DEC, the only way they support this is by loading Phase V
DECNet on the OSF/1 system.  Loading Phase V DECnet just to download some
