        comp.answers and news.answers newsgroups
        ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/dec-faq
        ftp://rtfm.mit.edu/pub/usenet/news.answers/dec-faq
        http://www.cis.ohio-state.edu/hypertext/faq/usenet/dec-faq/osf.html

