at ftp://ftp.cc.rochester.edu/pub/usenet/comp.unix.ultrix  I don't know
if there's an archive for comp.unix.osf.osf1 (if there is, I'd appreciate
a pointer.)

There is no specific Alpha FAQ - many Alpha-related issues are covered in the
OSF/1 and OpenVMS FAQs.
