compilation -- we are talking about 5-10 minutes, maximum, and the
linkage phase only goes 50 seconds before we receive the error message.

I received the following response from DEC regarding the problem:

> 1. There were several patches related to NFS server & clients in OSF
>    2.1, so you should upgrade to 2.1 atleast those 2 machines (if not
